SUMMARY:Chem: WTM-37
DESCRIPTION:Syllabus: Track I - d-block and compounds: general characterist
 ics\; oxidation states\; colour\; magnetic properties\; alloys\; trends in
  stability of higher oxidation states\; electrode potentials\; chemical re
 activity\; interstitial compounds\; preparation and properties of KMnO4 an
 d K2Cr2O7. Track II - concentration cells\; dry cells\; fuel cells\; lead 
 storage battery\; numericals\; corrosion\; passivity.
END:VEVENT
